<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.9.9">
<l>tēvuṭaiya mīṉamā yāmaiyā</l>
<l rend="indent">yēṉamā yariyāyk kuṟaḷāy</l>
<l>mūvuruvi ṉirāmaṉāyk kaṇṇaṉāyk</l>
<l rend="indent">kaṟkiyāy muṭippāṅ kōyil</l>
<l>cēvaloṭu peṭaiyaṉṉam ceṅkamala</l>
<l rend="indent">malarēṟi yūca lāṭi</l>
<l>pūvaṇaimēl tutainteḻucem poṭiyāṭi</l>
<l rend="indent">viḷaiyāṭum puṉala raṅkamē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>The temple of him who became the divine fish,</l>
<l rend="indent">tortoise, boar, lion, dwarf, [and] the three,</l>
<l rend="indent">Rāma, Kaṇṇaṉ, and ending with Kalki,</l>
<l>is in Araṅkam on the waters</l>
<l rend="indent">where male and female swans mount red lotus flowers,</l>
<l rend="indent">swinging and dancing,</l>
<l rend="indent">[and] crowd [together] on a flower bed,</l>
<l rend="indent">bathing and playing in the spreading red pollen.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
